notes.content:
New and optimize:
-Optimized performance efficiency;

Fix issues：
-Fixed the issue of random displacement when characters move;

Update Notes 2.0.3

New and optimize:
- Optimized the conditions for story ending in multiplay;
- Optimized the left click area for UI when select packages in multiplay;
- Optimized the voice of "Center Control" display screen in multiplay;

Fix issues：
- Fix the issue of room list fails to refresh and existing rooms are not shown in multiplay;
- Fix the issue of an interface display error when exiting multiplay;
- Fix the issue of the time bar display incorrectly after upgrading the "Focus" ability  in story mode.

New and optimize:
- Reduce the frequency of prompt speech when using the "Sense" skill;
- When launching the game, add voice of title;
- Add voice when carryign packages more than the allowable amount;
- Add voice when statu is full;

Fix issues：
- Fix the issue of counting errors when obtaining Bath ticket;
- Fix the issue of button errors when opening the "Status" interface;
- Fixed mismatching voice of the  saving content when visiting rest house the first time;

Fix issues：

-Fixed the issue of BGM not playing;

-Fixed the issue of energy errors during running;

-Fixed the issue of incorrect calendar display;

Fix issues：

- Fixed the issue of unable to enter the game after "Oddity Game" logo by hardware compatibility；

- Fixed some issues of incorrect text displayed in the Japanese version;

Fix issues:

-Fixed the issue of screen flashing when unlocking the new area;

-Fixed some voice issues during meals;

Update Notes 1.2.0

New and optimize:
- "SENSE"  function also work on gray package；
- Optimize "SENSE" details in the "Status" of the rest house;
- New Content in "Help"of the sorting center ;
- Bath ticket cost adjustment -6->-10

Fix issues：
- Fixed some issues of incorrect text displayed in the Japanese version;
- Fixed some issues of incorrect text displayed in the English version;
- Fixed the issue of incorrect display of annotation text color in the Esc UI and Delete data UI;
- Fixed the issue of BGM setting；

Fix issues：

- Fix item detail discrimination（Pink Larva、Cap、Green Eel） ;

- Fix “Heavy” detail discrimination ( 7-> 6 ) ;

- All "confirm" operation can used "F" key and "Space" key now ;
